Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 23:56:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Bound annotation refresh and share serve notice
 probes

Urgent reversible mitigation: HERMES_ANNOTATION_COALESCE defaults on with a 3s event floor; HERMES_NOTIFICATION_SHARED_WINDOW defaults on with process-wide 2s structural reuse. Set each to 0 for rollback. No shared claims or ACKs; strict callers retain literal reads. No fact_* changes or serve signalling.

Proof: canonical annotation and new notifier batch: 53 passed; notifier existing suites: 209 passed in subtask. scripts/check: 21 checks passed. Deterministic 100-event/1s holder test proves bounded trailing work and zero post-bootstrap idle reads.
